<h2>About Student Service Portal</h2>

<p>
    The Student Service Portal is a simple online system designed
    to help students submit service requests easily.
</p>

<p>
    Students can provide their information, select the type of service
    they need, and upload supporting documents.
</p>

<h3>How it works</h3>

<ol>
    <li>Complete the service request form.</li>
    <li>Submit your information.</li>
    <li>Receive a confirmation with your request details.</li>
</ol>

